1
00:01:17,960 --> 00:01:19,320
I just wanted

2
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:21,640
to live.

3
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:24,000
I just wanted to live.

4
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:26,160
But God,

5
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:28,280
God is unfair to me.

6
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:31,600
I have been living carefully with illness.

7
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:33,960
My only wish was to get a good medicine

8
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:38,280
for a body that can walk freely.

9
00:01:38,759 --> 00:01:39,960
Later, I learned

10
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,920
that Liang Mountain has good medicine.

11
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:43,400
I was full of expectations.

12
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:45,280
Waiting for Liangshan people to come to Dongjing,

13
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,600
I took great pains

14
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:49,920
to follow you into the dark den of Yunxiang Pavilion

15
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:51,800
and fight against the Imperial City Department.

16
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:54,160
I wholeheartedly advised you.

17
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:56,729
Zhu'er even lost her life for this.

18
00:01:56,960 --> 00:01:58,360
But in the end, you tell me

19
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:00,160
it's all too late.

20
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:03,760
My body couldn't wait any longer.

21
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:05,240
I won't survive.

22
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,080
And what about you?

23
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,300
The Emperor is absurd,

24
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,660
wanting to marry me off to a sixty-year-old man.

25
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,400
The whole Zhao family

26
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:21,100
is waiting to use me to advance their official careers.

27
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,880
The dismissal and reinstatement of court officials are treated like a trifling game.

28
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:26,160
The Emperor deserves to die.

29
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:27,200
The Zhao family deserves to die too.

30
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:28,530
They all deserve to die.

31
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,000
Han'er.

32
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,610
The Zhao family.

33
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:37,380
What happened to the Zhao Residence?

34
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,090
The Zhao Residence.

35
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,810
The Zhao Residence.

36
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:48,280
Naturally, it was completely destroyed.

37
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,760
Where are my sister-in-law and sister?

38
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:56,079
Where are my sister-in-law and sister?

39
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:58,800
Your sister-in-law and sister?

40
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:10,520
How can I trouble Lady Zhao to pour tea herself?

41
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:14,080
My sister-in-law made sweet dumplings for me herself.

42
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,340
She deserves this tea.

43
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,820
Sister Xiaolian did, too.

44
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,210
Sister-in-law.

45
00:03:37,880 --> 00:03:39,680
Sorry to trouble you, Lady Zhao.

46
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,800
Haven't you been looking for the medicine,

47
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:47,880
working so hard?

48
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:49,560
I merely...

49
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,000
took the Taoist priest's elixir...

50
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,520
I added a few rare poisons

51
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,840
and served it to them.

52
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,200
By the way.

53
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,520
When I left the mansion,

54
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,600
were they sleeping

55
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,760
peacefully?

56
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,480
Don't go.

57
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:17,279
It's useless.

58
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:23,040
How do you think

59
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:26,320
those knife sellers got in?

60
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:28,840
I made a deal with them.

61
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,640
I had them

62
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:33,040
pour oil all over

63
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:35,760
the Zhao Manor.

64
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,400
Tonight,

65
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:50,159
the moment the whole of Dongjing lights up,

66
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,240
the Zhao Manor

67
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:56,560
should be burning.

68
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,760
Let's go together

69
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,800
and be buried with Zhu'er.

70
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:25,320
Take them down.

71
00:06:43,280 --> 00:06:44,940
Are you sure you want to leave?

72
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:47,560
Yes.

73
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:54,170
If you ever return to Dongjing,

74
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:56,600
need anything,

75
00:06:58,159 --> 00:06:59,360
want a job,

76
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,520
or anything else,

77
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:02,940
just come to me.

78
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,370
You just need to ask.

79
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,120
I will grant any request.

80
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:19,960
Thank you for your care, Lord Duzhi.

81
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:22,920
Thank you

82
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:27,060
for finding his daughter for him.

83
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,060
Where are we going?

84
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,559
On such a beautiful day.

85
00:08:35,159 --> 00:08:36,159
The world is vast.

86
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,500
We can go anywhere.

87
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,000
From now on,

88
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,200
I'll call you Brother Qisi.
